  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L101",
      "speaker": "ANNA",
      "text": "Numbers get a counter. From two thousand five hundred down to seventy two."
    },
    {
      "id": "L102",
      "speaker": "MAX",
      "text": "Dates get a timeline, and every milestone appears exactly when the voice names it: first January, then October, then December."
    },
    {
      "id": "L103",
      "speaker": "ANNA",
      "text": "Then and now is a split. Missing footage stays visible as a placeholder, so you always know what is left to find."
    },
    {
      "id": "L104",
      "speaker": "MAX",
      "text": "Rules and advice become a checklist."
    },
    {
      "id": "L105",
      "speaker": "ANNA",
      "text": "Who knew whom is a network: the founder first, then the partner and the rival."
    },
    {
      "id": "L106",
      "speaker": "ANNA",
      "text": "And the words of a real person become a quote, always with a source."
    },
    {
      "id": "L107",
      "speaker": "MAX",
      "text": "That is the whole idea. Write the script, anchor the scenes, check, render, watch, fix.",
      "pauseAfter": 1
    }
  ],
